lapigo.yaml:7:12: warning: sort key "created_at" may change after the row is created
   7 |     sort: [created_at, slug, id]
     |            ^^^^^^^^^^
   a row whose sort value changes can move relative to a live cursor; this is inherent to keyset pagination and does not block generation. Mark `created_at` `immutable: true` if its value must never change once set (spec §3.3 rule 5)